GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "85E3F3644ADED409"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{570ED356B7F1B735}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Summary"
     m_sContent "A small pocket of separatist fighters remains entrenched within their final strongpoint—an apartment building—after being pushed back, overrun, and encircled by Russian Federation forces."\
     "This isolated element represents the last organized resistance in the area. Russian forces must eliminate this holdout in order to fully secure the city and consolidate control."\
     ""\
     "<h2>Notes</h2>"\
     "• Setup timer: Russian Federation (RU) = 4mins"
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{83D5A7EA97A29567}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "<h2>PRELIMS</h2>"\
     "DTL: 14/07/2002, 1200hr, Kamensk, Cain."\
     "Weather: Random weather."\
     ""\
     "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
     "For weeks, fighting has raged across the city. Block by block, Russian Federation forces have advanced, collapsing defensive lines and isolating pockets of resistance. What began as coordinated separatist control has deteriorated into fragmented strongpoints, each fighting alone."\
     "Overnight, the final defensive belt was breached. Armored elements punched through the outer districts while mechanized infantry sealed off escape routes. Communications between separatist units have gone silent one by one."\
     "Now, only a single apartment complex remains under separatist control."\
     "The surviving fighters—what is left of a once full-strength company—have withdrawn into the building, turning it into a last stand position. They are surrounded, cut off from reinforcement, and low on supplies, but still armed and dangerous. From upper floors and shattered windows, they command sightlines over key streets and approach routes."\
     "Until this strongpoint is neutralized, the city cannot be declared secure."\
     "The encirclement is complete. The outcome now depends on how quickly and decisively the remaining resistance is dealt with."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{390ADBB0EABBBF2E}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "<h2>PRELIMS</h2>"\
     "DTL: 14/07/2002, 1200hr, Kamensk, Cain."\
     "Weather: Random weather."\
     ""\
     "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
     "For weeks, fighting has raged across the city. Block by block, Russian Federation forces have advanced, collapsing defensive lines and isolating pockets of resistance. What began as coordinated separatist control has deteriorated into fragmented strongpoints, each fighting alone."\
     "Overnight, the final defensive belt was breached. Armored elements punched through the outer districts while mechanized infantry sealed off escape routes. Communications between separatist units have gone silent one by one."\
     "Now, only a single apartment complex remains under separatist control."\
     "The surviving fighters—what is left of a once full-strength company—have withdrawn into the building, turning it into a last stand position. They are surrounded, cut off from reinforcement, and low on supplies, but still armed and dangerous. From upper floors and shattered windows, they command sightlines over key streets and approach routes."\
     "Until this strongpoint is neutralized, the city cannot be declared secure."\
     "The encirclement is complete. The outcome now depends on how quickly and decisively the remaining resistance is dealt with."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{AEE86A0E20183D0C}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2> "\
     "Enemy forces consist of hardened separatist fighters."\
     "Estimated strength is approximately 25 personnel."\
     "They are currently dug in and making a final stand within the apartment block (GRID: 117106 )."\
     ""\
     "The apartment building is a large complex consisting of 5 floors and a rooftop. With roughly 50 meters of frontage along it's largest sides."\
     "Fortifed with dug-in fighting positions and good 360 degree sightlines."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• There is a PKM turret on the 3rd floor west facing balcony."\
     "• The enemy is completely isolated and cut off from reinforcements and external support. They are assessed to have limited capabilities, low morale, and dwindling supplies."\
     "• However, fighters with no avenue of escape can become highly determined and unpredictable. Expect them to exploit every available advantage, even at significant cost, and to resist fiercely despite their situation."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{0D6E5518FC0050C5}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2> "\
     "We are elements of the 144th Guards Motor Rifle Division, 254th Guards Motor Rifle Regiment, consisting of 42 personnel."\
     "We are currently located at the staging area, preparing to step off toward the designated insertion points."\
     ""\
     "After the setup timer has ended, we may deploy to any designated insertion location via the doors at the staging area."\
     "A mock-up model of the target building is available where we start."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2> "\
     "• We have total freedom of movement within the city. All other organized enemy resistance has been neutralized, which gives us the  time required to properly position, coordinate, and prepare for the assault without external interference."\
     " "\
     "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2> "\
     "A supply crate is available at the staging location containing:"\
     "• 8x deployable ladders"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{5C9BE1910AA40136}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2> "\
     "Enemy forces consist of elements of the 144th Guards Motor Rifle Division, 254th Guards Motor Rifle Regiment."\
     "They are dispersed throughout the city of Kamensk, having secured all areas except this building and its immediate surroundings."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2> "\
     "• The enemy has total freedom of movement within the city. With no remaining resistance outside this position, they can take their time to plan, coordinate, and prepare their assault without fear of disruption."\
     "• They are able to establish overwatch positions, including sniper teams and support elements, in surrounding buildings and maintain sustained pressure over time, gradually degrading our defenses."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{7BFDC158FDFAB186}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2> "\
     "We are the few remaining separatist fighters."\
     "Just one week ago, this city was held by many of our comrades. Due to a series of setbacks and poor command decisions, all have fallen but us."\
     "Current strength: 24 personnel."\
     "We are located at our final strongpoint - an apartment building (GRID: 117106)."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2> "\
     "• The apartment block provides strong defensive potential, with good sightlines and numerous fighting positions."\
     "• We maintain 360-degree coverage across five floors and a rooftop."\
     "• The building contains two internal stairwells and one external ladder, allowing access to each level and the roof."\
     "• We have a PKM turret on the 3rd floor west facing balcony."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{8EE1AC2D92975067}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2> "\
     "We are to conduct a DELIBERATE ASSAULT on the apartment building in order to destroy the remaining separatist forces and enable full security of the city."\
     ""\
     "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
     "Over the past week, separatist forces have been steadily pushed back across the city."\
     " Their defensive lines have collapsed, and organized resistance has been systematically eliminated."\
     "The surviving elements have withdrawn to a fortified apartment building, where they intend to make their final stand."\
     "Cut off and isolated from any supporting forces, these remaining enemy fighters represent the last obstacle to securing the city."\
     "We will assault, clear, and eliminate all resistance within the strongpoint. "
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{B5658D2829977F9B}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2> "\
     "We are to conduct a DELIBERATE DEFENSE of the apartment building and hold it against all enemy assault."\
     ""\
     "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
     "This is it.. our last stand."\
     "For the past week, Russian forces have unleashed a relentless assault on the city, crushing nearly all separatist resistance. We are the last remaining element still holding ground."\
     "There will be no reinforcements. No relief."\
     "We hold this building as our final strongpoint. Make the enemy pay for every room, every stairwell, every inch they attempt to take."\
     "If we fall, we do so on our terms — and we ensure they pay dearly for it."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_SEPARATIST"
     }
    }
